 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 President Trump pardons "Freedom" the turkey at the White House today. Photo: Jim Watson/AFP via Getty Images 🦃 President Trump pardoned turkeys "Freedom" and "Feathers" today after praising his White House ballroom project and delivering a rally-style speech. Go deeper . 💥 The U.S. Army plans to detonate bomb-making chemicals in Iowa tomorrow after getting approval from a federal appeals court — the latest in a saga that has confused and alarmed locals. Go deeper . 🆘 Microsoft declared a "Code Red" to change how it responds to major outages, Reuters reports. That's after Outlook, Teams and other popular workplace apps went down for 24 hours earlier this month. Go deeper . 🔭 Scientists have discovered the most distant quasar yet — the core of a galaxy with a black hole at its center dating back to nearly the dawn of the universe. Go deeper . 
 
